A float-valued pair lands as a plain, unquoted scalar, so the frontmatter reloads it as
a number.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md ratio=1.5
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
 status: backlog
+ratio: 1.5
 ---
 # My Plan
 
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: ratio=1.5
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
ratio: 1.5
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
